        <headline>red warning - tornado - ended</headline>
        <description>
Tornadoes associated with this alert are no longer expected in the area.


###
</description>
        <instruction/>
        <web>https://weather.gc.ca/</web>
        <parameter>
            <valueName>layer:EC-MSC-SMC:1.0:Alert_Type</valueName>
            <value>warning</value>
