            <value>At 9:09 p.m. Central Standard Time Saturday, Environment Canada has ended a tornado warning for West Central Saskatchewan.  Meadow Lake, Pierceland, Goodsoil, Green lake, Waterhen Reserve and Big River. Tornadoes associated with this alert are no longer expected in the area. </value>
